# DAU — Formüller & Eşikler

## Delta
```
DELTA_THRESHOLD_NOISE  = 0.1  # NO_TRACE
DELTA_THRESHOLD_NORMAL = 0.4  # NORMAL
DELTA_THRESHOLD_DEEP   = 0.7  # DEEP
# üstü: TRAUMA → drift
M = 0.70·max(PE_vec) + 0.30·mean(PE_vec)  # MAGNITUDE_PEAK_WEIGHT
```

## Memory Score (v2.0 — PPR)
```
memory_score = 0.21·recency + 0.28·magnitude
             + 0.21·domain_match + 0.30·ppr_score
# PPR_ALPHA=0.85, PPR_WEIGHT_IN_SCORE=0.30
```

## Ebbinghaus
```
t = now_counter - record.last_activated_counter
S = max(1, round(record.magnitude / S_UNIT))  # S_UNIT = 0.1
R = exp(-t / S)
# Recall: S += 1 · Travma silinmez (TRAUMA_S_BASE = 10)
```

## InternalState / DAERM
- `energy` (setpoint 1.0)
- `resource_load` / `uncertainty_load` / `social_load`
- `γ(t) = E/(1+M_total)` · `μ_i = min(M_i/(1+M_i), 0.75)`

## Layer 1.5 Prediction Error
```
prediction_error = 1 - cosine_sim_MiniLM(expected, actual)
# Jaccard diagnostik only; NLI gate preference pairs (ADIM 2)
```

## Layer 2 EmotionalWeight
```
threat  = clamp(magnitude · resource_load, 0, 1)
reward  = clamp((1 − magnitude) · energy, 0, 1)
novelty = clamp(magnitude · uncertainty_load, 0, 1)
social  = clamp(social_load, 0, 1)
loss    = 1.0 if is_trauma else 0.0
```

## Layer 2 Drift + ADIM 1 crisis
```
trauma → flags[domain]=True; magnitudes[domain] += magnitude×exp(−current)
pool_ratio < 0.30 → resource trauma × CRISIS_TRAUMA_MULTIPLIER(2.5)
```

